# The build stage runs `pnpm install` from the lockfile and `pnpm run build`,
# so host artifacts must not bleed into the image: node_modules would clobber
# the freshly-installed (store-linked) tree, and a host dist/.db/.env could ship
# stale code or secrets. Keep the build context to source + manifests only.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.turbo
.turbo
.git
.github
.idea
.vscode

# Local data and secrets. Never bake these into the image.
**/*.db
**/*.db-shm
**/*.db-wal
data
**/data
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Dev-only paperless ingest folder + scratch.
docker/paperless-consume
tmp
*.log
